          Search All Comparisons
        </a>
        <a href="/comparison/phones" class="flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-700/50 rounded-lg">
